title Phase 2: Chess Server Design

actor Client
participant Server
participant Handler
participant Service
participant DataAccess
database Database

note over Handler,DataAccess: Requests and results use JSON-mapped Java records. DataAccess hides the storage implementation.

group #gray Clear application (/db) #white
Client -> Server: DELETE /db
Server -> Handler: route /db
Handler -> Service: clear()
Service -> DataAccess: clear()
DataAccess -> Database: DELETE all users, auth tokens, and games
Database --> DataAccess: success
DataAccess --> Service: success
Service --> Handler: ClearResult
Handler -> Handler: serialize({})
Handler --> Server: 200 {}
Server --> Client: 200 {}
end

group #navy Register (/user) #white
Client -> Server: POST /user\n{username, password, email}
Server -> Handler: route /user
Handler -> Handler: deserialize RegisterRequest
alt malformed JSON or missing fields
Handler --> Server: 400 bad request
Server --> Client: 400 {message}
else valid request
Handler -> Service: register(request)
Service -> DataAccess: getUser(username)
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT user by username
Database --> DataAccess: UserData or null
DataAccess --> Service: UserData or null
alt username already exists
Service --> Handler: AlreadyTakenException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 403 {message}
else username is available
Service -> DataAccess: createUser(UserData)
DataAccess -> Database: INSERT UserData
Database --> DataAccess: success
Service -> DataAccess: createAuth(username)
DataAccess -> Database: INSERT AuthData
Database --> DataAccess: AuthData
DataAccess --> Service: AuthData
Service --> Handler: RegisterResult
Handler -> Handler: serialize result
Handler --> Server: 200 {username, authToken}
Server --> Client: 200 {username, authToken}
end
end
end

group #orange Login (/session) #white
Client -> Server: POST /session\n{username, password}
Server -> Handler: route /session
Handler -> Handler: deserialize LoginRequest
alt malformed JSON or missing fields
Handler --> Server: 400 bad request
Server --> Client: 400 {message}
else valid request
Handler -> Service: login(request)
Service -> DataAccess: getUser(username)
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT user by username
Database --> DataAccess: UserData or null
DataAccess --> Service: UserData or null
alt user missing or password does not match
Service --> Handler: UnauthorizedException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 401 {message}
else credentials are valid
Service -> DataAccess: createAuth(username)
DataAccess -> Database: INSERT AuthData
Database --> DataAccess: AuthData
DataAccess --> Service: AuthData
Service --> Handler: LoginResult
Handler -> Handler: serialize result
Handler --> Server: 200 {username, authToken}
Server --> Client: 200 {username, authToken}
end
end
end

group #green Logout (/session) #white
Client -> Server: DELETE /session\nAuthorization: authToken
Server -> Handler: route /session
Handler -> Handler: deserialize LogoutRequest
Handler -> Service: logout(authToken)
Service -> DataAccess: getAuth(authToken)
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT AuthData by token
Database --> DataAccess: AuthData or null
DataAccess --> Service: AuthData or null
alt authToken is invalid
Service --> Handler: UnauthorizedException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 401 {message}
else authToken is valid
Service -> DataAccess: deleteAuth(authToken)
DataAccess -> Database: DELETE AuthData
Database --> DataAccess: success
DataAccess --> Service: success
Service --> Handler: LogoutResult
Handler --> Server: 200 {}
Server --> Client: 200 {}
end
end

group #red List games (/game) #white
Client -> Server: GET /game\nAuthorization: authToken
Server -> Handler: route /game
Handler -> Service: listGames(authToken)
Service -> DataAccess: getAuth(authToken)
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT AuthData by token
Database --> DataAccess: AuthData or null
DataAccess --> Service: AuthData or null
alt authToken is invalid
Service --> Handler: UnauthorizedException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 401 {message}
else authToken is valid
Service -> DataAccess: listGames()
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT all GameData
Database --> DataAccess: list of GameData
DataAccess --> Service: list of GameData
Service --> Handler: ListGamesResult
Handler -> Handler: serialize result
Handler --> Server: 200 {games}
Server --> Client: 200 {games}
end
end

group #purple Create game (/game) #white
Client -> Server: POST /game\nAuthorization: authToken\n{gameName}
Server -> Handler: route /game
Handler -> Handler: deserialize CreateGameRequest
alt malformed JSON or missing fields
Handler --> Server: 400 bad request
Server --> Client: 400 {message}
else valid request
Handler -> Service: createGame(request, authToken)
Service -> DataAccess: getAuth(authToken)
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT AuthData by token
Database --> DataAccess: AuthData or null
DataAccess --> Service: AuthData or null
alt authToken is invalid
Service --> Handler: UnauthorizedException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 401 {message}
else authToken is valid
Service -> DataAccess: createGame(GameData)
DataAccess -> Database: INSERT GameData with new gameID
Database --> DataAccess: GameData
DataAccess --> Service: gameID
Service --> Handler: CreateGameResult
Handler -> Handler: serialize result
Handler --> Server: 200 {gameID}
Server --> Client: 200 {gameID}
end
end
end

group #yellow Join game (/game) #black
Client -> Server: PUT /game\nAuthorization: authToken\n{playerColor, gameID}
Server -> Handler: route /game
Handler -> Handler: deserialize JoinGameRequest
alt malformed JSON or missing fields
Handler --> Server: 400 bad request
Server --> Client: 400 {message}
else valid request
Handler -> Service: joinGame(request, authToken)
Service -> DataAccess: getAuth(authToken)
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT AuthData by token
Database --> DataAccess: AuthData or null
DataAccess --> Service: AuthData or null
alt authToken is invalid
Service --> Handler: UnauthorizedException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 401 {message}
else authToken is valid
Service -> DataAccess: getGame(gameID)
DataAccess -> Database: SELECT GameData by gameID
Database --> DataAccess: GameData or null
DataAccess --> Service: GameData or null
alt game does not exist
Service --> Handler: BadRequestException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 400 {message}
else requested color is already occupied
Service --> Handler: AlreadyTakenException
Handler --> Server: error response
Server --> Client: 403 {message}
else color is available
Service -> DataAccess: updateGame(GameData with player)
DataAccess -> Database: UPDATE GameData
Database --> DataAccess: success
DataAccess --> Service: success
Service --> Handler: JoinGameResult
Handler --> Server: 200 {}
Server --> Client: 200 {}
end
end
end
end

note over Server,Database: Any DataAccessException is propagated to the server and translated into HTTP 500 {message}.
